    /// ⌫, ⌦, Edit ▸ Delete or Edit ▸ Ripple Delete with words selected:
    /// planned again, refused in TX-32's order, else one "Delete Words"; with
    /// a pause selected, `deletePause`.
    func deleteWords() {
